item.description:
Use Grid System with CSS classes hoo-grid - defines the base CSS Grid on any container
Use Grid System with SCSS Through a mixing you can turn any container into a grid system.
Placing elements on the grid The placement of elements can be accomplished with the following SASS mixin.
The SASS mixing has the following input:
@include gridSpan([grid span], [Starting column], [Starting row]);
SCSS Imports Main Component
@n8d/htwoo-core/components/base
